      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Once you have made your first steel, you can craft a small backpack. It has 36 slots, nine more than a small chest. You can upgrade it later.\n\nYou can carry up to four of these backpacks in your inventory.\n\nYou can wear a backpack and set it to pick up items automatically. In Controls, assign a key to \"Open Backpack\" and check for conflicts. Hold Sneak and press that key to open the back-slot screen and equip your backpack. Once it is equipped, press Open Backpack on its own to open it.\n\nTo rename a backpack, hold it in your hand, hold Sneak, and right-click.",
